    <li><a href="https://www.aikido.dev/blog/critical-vulnerabilities-in-php-php2shell" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Aikido: PHP2Shell</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://flareapp.io/blog/a-critical-php-vulnerability-what-we-did-and-what-you-should-do" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Flare: what we did and what you should do</a></li>
  </ul>
